	<section_number>46.2-929</section_number>
	<catch_line>Pedestrians soliciting rides</catch_line>
	<text>
		Pedestrians shall not stand or stop in any roadway for the purpose of soliciting rides.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 46-247; 1950, p. 850; 1958, c. 541, § 46.1-234; 1968, c. 165; 1989, c. 727.</history>
